---
title: Mobile API & Auth Flow — Fungus Android v8.0
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant AS as AsyncStorage<br/>(cache)
    participant SS as SecureStore<br/>(JWT)
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>fungus-api.onrender.com
    participant Google as Google OAuth

    %% ── App startup ──
    Note over App,SS: App startup — auth guard
    App->>SS: getItemAsync("fungus_jwt")
    alt token absent
        App-->>App: redirect → /auth/login
    else token present
        App->>API: GET /auth/me (Bearer token)
        alt 401 Unauthorized
            App-->>App: clear token → /auth/login
        else 200 OK
            App-->>App: load main tabs
        end
    end

    %% ── Login (email/password) ──
    Note over App,API: Email + password login
    App->>API: POST /auth/login { email, password }
    API-->>App: { access_token }
    App->>SS: setItemAsync("fungus_jwt", token)
    App-->>App: redirect → /(tabs)

    %% ── Google OAuth (mobile PKCE) ──
    Note over App,Google: Google OAuth (PKCE flow)
    App->>Google: open authorization URL (expo-auth-session)
    Google-->>App: redirect fungus://auth/callback?code=...
    App->>API: POST /auth/google/mobile { code, code_verifier }
    Note right of API: ⚠️ New endpoint — not yet implemented
    API->>Google: exchange code → access token
    Google-->>API: { google_access_token }
    API-->>App: { access_token (Fungus JWT) }
    App->>SS: setItemAsync("fungus_jwt", token)

    %% ── Data fetch with cache ──
    Note over App,API: Zones + weather fetch (with cache)
    App->>AS: getItem("fungus_weather_v3")
    alt cache hit (age < 3h, version matches)
        AS-->>App: cached conditions data
        App-->>App: render with cached data
    else cache miss or stale
        App->>API: GET /weather/zones
        API-->>App: zone conditions[]
        App->>API: GET /zones
        API-->>App: zones[]
        App-->>App: compute overallScore (scoring.ts)
        App->>AS: setItem("fungus_weather_v3", { ts, v:3, data })
        App-->>App: render
    end

    %% ── Species detail ──
    Note over App,API: Species detail (no cache)
    App->>API: GET /species/{id}?lang=es
    API-->>App: species detail + extra_data
    App-->>App: render SpeciesDetail screen
